<div class="oils-cards-container">
	<h3 class="oils-section-title">Cooking Fats & Oils: Carnivore vs Low-Inflammation Options</h3>
	<p class="oils-section-subtitle">Pure oils contain zero sugar and zero carbohydrates. Adding these healthy fats boosts daily energy without triggering oral acid fermentation.</p>
	
	<div class="oils-cards-grid">
		<!-- 1. Grass-Fed Ghee -->
		<div class="oil-card animal-fat-card">
			<div class="oil-emoji-hero">🧈</div>
			<h4 class="oil-name">Grass-Fed Ghee</h4>
			<div class="oil-badge">Animal Fat | Zero Acid</div>
			<ul class="oil-stats-list">
				<li><strong>Smoke Point:</strong> 485°F (250°C)</li>
				<li><strong>Key Benefit:</strong> Pure milk fat with lactose & casein removed. Rich in gut-healing butyrate.</li>
				<li><strong>Best Use:</strong> High-heat frying, searing steaks, or tossing warm vegetables.</li>
			</ul>
		</div>

		<!-- 2. Beef Tallow & Suet -->
		<div class="oil-card animal-fat-card">
			<div class="oil-emoji-hero">🥩</div>
			<h4 class="oil-name">Beef Tallow</h4>
			<div class="oil-badge">Animal Fat | Zero Acid</div>
			<ul class="oil-stats-list">
				<li><strong>Smoke Point:</strong> 400°F (205°C)</li>
				<li><strong>Key Benefit:</strong> Traditional carnivore fat with neutral tissue pH (~6.5). Zero plant oxalates.</li>
				<li><strong>Best Use:</strong> Skillet cooking ground beef, roasting, or pan-frying.</li>
			</ul>
		</div>

		<!-- 3. Duck Fat & Bacon Drippings -->
		<div class="oil-card animal-fat-card">
			<div class="oil-emoji-hero">🥓</div>
			<h4 class="oil-name">Duck Fat & Bacon Drippings</h4>
			<div class="oil-badge">Animal Fat | Zero Acid</div>
			<ul class="oil-stats-list">
				<li><strong>Smoke Point:</strong> ~375°F (190°C)</li>
				<li><strong>Key Benefit:</strong> Highly flavorful, zero-carb fats that provide dense calorie support.</li>
				<li><strong>Best Use:</strong> Sautéing mushrooms, asparagus, or crisping skin-on chicken.</li>
			</ul>
		</div>

		<!-- 4. Avocado Oil -->
		<div class="oil-card plant-oil-card">
			<div class="oil-emoji-hero">🥑</div>
			<h4 class="oil-name">Avocado Oil</h4>
			<div class="oil-badge">Plant Oil | Zero Sugar</div>
			<ul class="oil-stats-list">
				<li><strong>Smoke Point:</strong> 520°F (270°C)</li>
				<li><strong>Key Benefit:</strong> Extremely heat-stable monounsaturated fat with minimal mucosal irritation.</li>
				<li><strong>Best Use:</strong> High-heat searing, roasting vegetables, or light salad drizzles.</li>
			</ul>
		</div>

		<!-- 5. Extra Virgin Olive Oil -->
		<div class="oil-card plant-oil-card">
			<div class="oil-emoji-hero">🫒</div>
			<h4 class="oil-name">Extra Virgin Olive Oil</h4>
			<div class="oil-badge">Plant Oil | Zero Sugar</div>
			<ul class="oil-stats-list">
				<li><strong>Smoke Point:</strong> 375°F (190°C)</li>
				<li><strong>Key Benefit:</strong> Rich in oleic acid and anti-inflammatory polyphenols.</li>
				<li><strong>Best Use:</strong> Drizzling over warm cooked dishes or gentle low-heat cooking.</li>
			</ul>
		</div>

		<!-- 6. Organic Coconut Oil -->
		<div class="oil-card plant-oil-card">
			<div class="oil-emoji-hero">🥥</div>
			<h4 class="oil-name">Organic Coconut Oil</h4>
			<div class="oil-badge">Plant Fat | Zero Sugar</div>
			<ul class="oil-stats-list">
				<li><strong>Smoke Point:</strong> 350°F (177°C)</li>
				<li><strong>Key Benefit:</strong> High in lauric acid (natural antimicrobial). Great for mucosal soothing.</li>
				<li><strong>Best Use:</strong> Mild stir-frying, baking, or gentle oral swishing.</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>

<style>
.oils-cards-container {
	margin: 2.5rem 0;
}

.oils-section-title {
